  "explanation": "The question asks when the 'David Jones House' was built. The sources provide conflicting construction dates for different houses named 'David Jones House'.\n\n- **Document 1** (D1S4): States that the David H. Jones House in Spanish Fork, Utah, was built in **1912**.\n- **Document 3** (D3S2): States that the David H. Jones House (also in Spanish Fork, Utah) was built in **1895**.\n- **Document 4** (D4S3): Refers to a different David Jones House in Maryville, Tennessee, built in **1874** by a different David Jones.\n\nSince the question does not specify which 'David Jones House', both **1912** and **1895** are valid answers for the two distinct houses in Spanish Fork, Utah. The **1874** date refers to a different house in a different location and a different individual, so it is excluded."
